{"id":"G2089","lemma":"ἔτι","transliteration":"eti","sayIt":"eti","language":"Greek","partOfSpeech":"","gloss":"still","meaning":"ἔτι\nadv.,\nyet, as yet, still;\n1. of time;\n(a) of the present (adhuc): Mrk.5:35, 1Co.3:3 15:17, Gal.1:10, al.;\n(b) of the past, mostly with impf.: Mat.12:46, Luk.8:49 15:20, Jhn.20:1, Act.9:1, Rom.5:6, 8, 2Th.2:5, Heb.7:10 9:8, al.;\n(with) of the future: Luk.1:15, 2Co.1:10;\n(d) with a neg.: Mat.5:13, Luk.16:2 20:36, Heb.10:2, Rev.3:12 20:3, al.\n2. Of degree, even, yet, still, further: with compar., Php.1:9, Heb.7:15; of what remains, Mrk.12:6, Jhn.4:35 7:33, al.; of what is added, Mat.18:16 26:65, Heb.11:32 12:26-27; of con­tinuance apart from the idea of time, Rom.3:7 6:2 9:19, Gal.5:11; ἔτι δἐ, Act.2:26 (LXX), Heb.11:36; ἔτι τε καί, Luk.14:26, Act.21:28\n(AS)","glosses":["still","while","more","longer","again","any more"],"count":81,"occurrences":[{"chapterId":"mat-5","v":13,"renderings":{"bsb":"It is no longer good","kjv":"it is thenceforth"}},{"chapterId":"mat-12","v":46,"renderings":{"bsb":"While","kjv":"While"}},{"chapterId":"mat-17","v":5,"renderings":{"bsb":"While","kjv":"yet"}},{"chapterId":"mat-18","v":16,"renderings":{"bsb":"others","kjv":"more"}},{"chapterId":"mat-19","v":20,"renderings":{"bsb":"do I still lack"}},{"chapterId":"mat-26","v":47,"renderings":{"bsb":"was still speaking","kjv":"while"}},{"chapterId":"mat-26","v":65,"renderings":{"bsb":"any more","kjv":"further"}},{"chapterId":"mat-27","v":63,"renderings":{"bsb":"while","kjv":"while he was yet"}},{"chapterId":"mrk-5","v":35,"renderings":{"bsb":"While He was still speaking","kjv":"While"}},{"chapterId":"mrk-12","v":6,"renderings":{"bsb":"Finally","kjv":"yet"}},{"chapterId":"mrk-14","v":43,"renderings":{"bsb":"Jesus was still speaking","kjv":"yet"}},{"chapterId":"mrk-14","v":63,"renderings":{"bsb":"any more","kjv":"any further"}},{"chapterId":"luk-1","v":15,"renderings":{"bsb":"even","kjv":"even"}},{"chapterId":"luk-8","v":49,"renderings":{"bsb":"was still","kj